      "source": "The following example from Spring Data REST’s test suite shows Spring Security’s <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/authorization/expression-based.html#_access_control_using_preauthorize_and_postauthorize\">PreAuthorization model</a> (the most sophisticated security model):",
      "translation": "Spring Data REST 测试套件中的以下示例展示了 Spring Security 的<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/authorization/expression-based.html#_access_control_using_preauthorize_and_postauthorize\">预授权模型</a>（最复杂的安全模型）：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding example shows a standard Spring Data repository definition extending <code>CrudRepository</code> with some key changes: the specification of particular roles to access the various methods:",
      "translation": "前面的示例展示了一个标准的 Spring Data 仓库定义，它扩展了<code>CrudRepository</code>并包含一些关键变更：指定了用于访问各种方法的特定角色：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The previous example illustrates that <code>CrudRepository</code>, in fact, has four delete methods. You must override all delete methods to properly secure it.",
      "translation": "前面的示例表明，<code>CrudRepository</code> 实际上拥有四个删除方法。您必须重写所有删除方法才能正确保障其安全性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows Spring Security’s older <code>@Secured</code> annotation, which is purely role-based:",
      "translation": "下面的示例展示了 Spring Security 较旧的 `@Secured` 注解，该注解仅基于角色：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The rest of the configuration class is not listed, because it follows <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/configuration/java.html\">standard practices</a> that you can read about in the Spring Security reference docs.",
      "translation": "配置类的其余部分未列出，因为它遵循<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/configuration/java.html\">标准做法</a>，您可以在 Spring Security 参考文档中查阅相关内容。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data REST works quite well with Spring Security. This section shows examples of how to secure your Spring Data REST services with method-level security.",
      "translation": "Spring Data REST 与 Spring Security 配合使用效果良好。本节将展示如何使用方法级安全来保护您的 Spring Data REST 服务。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To configure method-level security, here is a brief snippet from Spring Data REST’s test suite:",
      "translation": "要配置方法级安全，以下是来自 Spring Data REST 测试套件的一个简短代码片段：",
      "count": 1
    },
