    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>This is a Spring configuration class.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>It uses Spring Security’s <code>@EnableGlobalMethodSecurity</code> annotation to enable both <code>@Secured</code> and <code>@Pre</code>/<code>@Post</code> support. NOTE: You don’t have to use both. This particular case is used to prove both versions work with Spring Data REST.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>This class extends Spring Security’s <code>WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter</code> which is used for pure Java configuration of security.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>这是一个 Spring 配置类。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>它使用 Spring Security 的 <code>@EnableGlobalMethodSecurity</code> 注解来同时启用 <code>@Secured</code> 和 <code>@Pre</code>/<code>@Post</code> 支持。注意：您不必同时使用两者。本例旨在证明这两个版本均能与 Spring Data REST 配合工作。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>该类扩展了 Spring Security 的 <code>WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter</code>，用于纯 Java 方式的安全配置。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>This Spring Security annotation secures the entire repository. The <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/authorization/expression-based.html\">Spring Security SpEL expression</a> indicates that the principal must have <code>ROLE_USER</code> in its collection of roles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>To change method-level settings, you must override the method signature and apply a Spring Security annotation. In this case, the method overrides the repository-level settings with the requirement that the user have <code>ROLE_ADMIN</code> to perform a delete.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>此 Spring Security 注解保护整个仓库。<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/authorization/expression-based.html\">Spring Security SpEL 表达式</a>表明，主体必须在其角色集合中包含 <code>ROLE_USER</code>。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>若要更改方法级别的设置，必须重写方法签名并应用 Spring Security 注解。在此情况下，该方法通过要求用户拥有 <code>ROLE_ADMIN</code> 角色来执行删除操作，从而覆盖了仓库级别的设置。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"anchor\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i></a>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/\">\n  Spring Security\n</a>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-authorization-server/reference/\">\n  Spring Authorization Server\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-ldap/reference/\">\n  Spring LDAP\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security-kerberos/reference/\">\n  Spring Security Kerberos\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-session/reference/\">\n  Spring Session\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-vault/reference/\">\n  Spring Vault\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"anchor\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i></a>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/\">\n  Spring Security\n</a>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-authorization-server/reference/\">\n  Spring Authorization Server\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-ldap/reference/\">\n  Spring LDAP\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security-kerberos/reference/\">\n  Spring Security Kerberos\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-session/reference/\">\n  Spring Session\n</a>\n</li>\n    <li>\n<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-vault/reference/\">\n  Spring Vault\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>This results in the same security check as the previous example but has less flexibility. It allows only roles as the means to restrict access.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Again, this shows that delete methods require <code>ROLE_ADMIN</code>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "1 这会产生与上一个示例相同的安全检查，但灵活性较低。它仅允许使用角色作为限制访问的手段。\n2 同样，这表明删除方法需要 <code>ROLE_ADMIN</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nIf you start with a new project or first apply Spring Security, <code>@PreAuthorize</code> is the recommended solution. If are already using Spring Security with <code>@Secured</code> in other parts of your app, you can continue on that path without rewriting everything.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n如果您从新项目开始或首次使用 Spring Security，推荐使用 <code>@PreAuthorize</code>。如果您已在应用程序的其他部分使用带有 <code>@Secured</code> 的 Spring Security，则可以继续沿用该方案，无需重写所有内容。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nRepository and method level security settings do not combine. Instead, method-level settings override repository level settings.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-important\" title=\"Important\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n仓库级别和方法级别的权限设置不会合并。相反，方法级别的设置会覆盖仓库级别的设置。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
